certificateDeclarationStandIn.title = Declaration – Submit a certificate
certificateDeclarationStandIn.caption = Cyflwynwch dystysgrif
certificateDeclarationStandIn.heading = Declaration
certificateDeclarationStandIn.paragraph1 = It is your responsibility to make sure the SAO has reviewed and approved the certificate before you submit.
certificateDeclarationStandIn.paragraph2 = Drwy gyflwyno’r dystysgrif hon, rydych yn cadarnhau’r canlynol:
certificateDeclarationStandIn.bulletPoint1 = mae’r wybodaeth yn gyflawn ac yn gywir
certificateDeclarationStandIn.bulletPoint2 = you have been authorised by the SAO to submit this certificate
certificateDeclarationStandIn.paragraph3 = Os byddwch chi’n rhoi gwybodaeth anghywir neu anghyflawn yn fwriadol, neu’n methu â rhoi gwybod am newidiadau, gallech fod yn agored i gosb o £5,000
certificateDeclarationStandIn.subheading = Rwy’n cadarnhau bod gen i’r awdurdod i gyflwyno’r dystysgrif hon.
certificateDeclarationStandIn.input1Label = Nodwch eich enw llawn
certificateDeclarationStandIn.input2Label = Nodwch enw llawn yr SAO a wnaeth eich awdurdodi
certificateDeclarationStandIn.confirmButtonText = Confirm

certificateDeclarationStandIn.standInName = StandInName
certificateDeclarationStandIn.saoName = SaoName

certificateDeclarationStandIn.checkYourAnswersLabel = Enw awdurdodedig ar y datganiad









certificateWhoIsSubmitting.title = Certificate submission and authorisation
certificateWhoIsSubmitting.caption = Cyflwynwch dystysgrif
certificateWhoIsSubmitting.heading = Certificate submission and authorisation
certificateWhoIsSubmitting.paragraph1 = HMRC needs to know if the certificate will be submitted by the SAO or by someone authorised to act on their behalf.
certificateWhoIsSubmitting.paragraph2 = The SAO must review and approve the certificate and authorise anyone submitting on their behalf.
certificateWhoIsSubmitting.sao = The SAO
certificateWhoIsSubmitting.label = Pwy sy’n cyflwyno’r dystysgrif?
certificateWhoIsSubmitting.standIn = A person authorised to submit on behalf of the SAO
